{{!
    @template local_dimensions/plan_journey

    The plan overview's third view, Journey: the plan's evidence over time, newest first, grouped by
    month. The server draws only the frame, hidden; local_dimensions/plan_journey fills the list from
    local_dimensions_get_plan_journey when the reader chooses the view, and writes every record as text.
    Drawn only for a viewer who gets the competencies' detail, the rule the service asks again.

    The frame holds: the list (a heading and an ordered list per month, written by the module); the
    skeleton while a page loads (aria-busy, one visually hidden status line); the empty state when the
    plan has no record; a compact line when the line's filters hide every record loaded so far; the
    error with its retry; and "Load more" for the next page. Words the module places come from here, in
    data attributes: the link to an evidence's address.

    Context variables required:
    * planid (int) - The plan id the module asks the service for

    @copyright  2026 Anderson Blaine
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "planid": 10
    }
}}
<section class="local-dimensions-journey" id="local-dimensions-viewplan-journey" data-region="local-dimensions-journey"
         data-planid="{{planid}}" data-label-link="{{#str}}journey_link, local_dimensions{{/str}}"
         aria-labelledby="local-dimensions-viewplan-journey-title" hidden>
    <h2 class="local-dimensions-line-sronly" id="local-dimensions-viewplan-journey-title">{{#str}}line_view_journey, local_dimensions{{/str}}</h2>
    <div class="local-dimensions-journey-list" data-region="local-dimensions-journey-list"></div>
    <div class="local-dimensions-journey-loading" data-region="local-dimensions-journey-loading" hidden>
        <div class="local-dimensions-sk" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="local-dimensions-sk-row"><span class="local-dimensions-sk-block local-dimensions-sk-block--ring"></span><span class="local-dimensions-sk-block local-dimensions-sk-block--line"></span></span>
            <span class="local-dimensions-sk-row"><span class="local-dimensions-sk-block local-dimensions-sk-block--ring"></span><span class="local-dimensions-sk-block local-dimensions-sk-block--line"></span></span>
            <span class="local-dimensions-sk-row"><span class="local-dimensions-sk-block local-dimensions-sk-block--ring"></span><span class="local-dimensions-sk-block local-dimensions-sk-block--line"></span></span>
        </div>
        <span class="local-dimensions-line-sronly" role="status">{{#str}}journey_loading, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="local-dimensions-empty" data-region="local-dimensions-journey-empty" role="status" hidden>
        <span class="local-dimensions-empty-icon">
            <i class="fa fa-history" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </span>
        <span class="local-dimensions-empty-title">{{#str}}journey_empty, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
        <span class="local-dimensions-empty-text">{{#str}}journey_empty_note, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="local-dimensions-journey-filtered" data-region="local-dimensions-journey-filtered" role="status" hidden>{{#str}}journey_filtered, local_dimensions{{/str}}</p>
    <div class="local-dimensions-journey-error" data-region="local-dimensions-journey-error" role="alert" hidden>
        <span>{{#str}}journey_error, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" data-action="local-dimensions-journey-retry">{{#str}}journey_retry, local_dimensions{{/str}}</button>
    </div>
    <div class="local-dimensions-journey-foot">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-action="local-dimensions-journey-more" hidden>{{#str}}journey_more, local_dimensions{{/str}}</button>
    </div>
</section>
